From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: swear01 <stanley.yellow1@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 11:55:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 56/94] fix(codex): fail closed when a shared rewind cannot
 complete

The hub treated a CLI `{ error }` reply to CompleteConversationRewind as
success, so a failed completion left the CLI barrier closed without
quarantining the session. Also clear the barrier token before unlinking on a
proven rejection, and never send an id-less error frame for a rejected
notification.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
